ui/dist/
# Generated by tauri-build on every build (ACL manifests and JSON schemas for the capability files,
# and the allow-/deny- permission for each of the app's commands).
src-tauri/gen/
src-tauri/permissions/autogenerated/
# Left by a standalone build before the crate joined the workspace; cargo ignores a member's own
# lock file (the root Cargo.lock is the one). Disposable.
src-tauri/Cargo.lock
